00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:38.280
going to have to do.

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:40.140
And lastly, we'll
also talk about how

00:01:40.140 --> 00:01:42.510
Google Cloud and in particular
Google Cloud Serverless

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:44.820
offerings make a
lot of that easy.

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:47.340
And in the places that we
